Package: slcflights
Title: Salt Lake City Flight Records and Supporting Metadata
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Aleksey", "Kulyukin", , "A02291810@usu.edu", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-4396-9878"))
Description: Provides tools for building and reading a local Salt Lake
    City-focused database from Bureau of Transportation Statistics (BTS)
    TranStats On-Time: Reporting Carrier On-Time Performance data. The package
    builds a BTS-sourced database from monthly BTS files, beginning with
    October 1987 and extending through a user-selected endpoint. It provides
    reader functions for scheduled origin/destination records, diversion-only
    records, reduced airport coordinate metadata, airline lookup metadata, and
    a field dictionary describing retained data columns. It also provides
    functions for updating, inspecting, and deleting the local database.
URL: https://github.com/AlKulAK/slcflights
